flowchart TD
  A[Map authorized source/destination] --> B[Preflight and dry-run]
  B --> C{Hard checks pass?}
  C -- No --> D[Block with reasons]
  C -- Yes --> E[Snapshot and manifest]
  E --> F[Initial transfer]
  F --> G[Delta sync]
  G --> H[Verify parity and access]
  H --> I{Cutover authorized?}
  I -- No --> J[Retain source and report ready]
  I -- Yes --> K[Cutover, monitor, verify]
